WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:01.040
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:01.929 --> 00:00:06.064
<v><b>M:</b></v> I glared at the driver who stole my parking space, but she just ignored me.

00:00:08.048 --> 00:00:08.715
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.511 --> 00:00:14.492
<v><b>F:</b></v> We waited for ages, but we only glimpsed the princess as the cars drove past.

00:00:16.444 --> 00:00:17.251
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:21.406
<v><b>M:</b></v> When I found Tom’s diary, I couldn’t resist peeking inside.

00:00:23.374 --> 00:00:24.104
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:24.945 --> 00:00:29.444
<v><b>F:</b></v> Those guys over there have been staring at us for ages – do you know them?

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:32.186
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:36.778
<v><b>M:</b></v> Steph glanced quickly at her notes before starting her presentation.

00:00:38.675 --> 00:00:39.614
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:40.368 --> 00:00:43.999
<v><b>F:</b></v> I peered through the window, but I couldn’t see anything in the darkness.

00:00:45.841 --> 00:00:46.693
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:47.462 --> 00:00:51.437
<v><b>M:</b></v> The lovers gazed into each other’s eyes, and time stood still.

00:00:53.366 --> 00:00:54.064
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:58.817
<v><b>F:</b></v> Everyone stood around gawping at the statue of a naked man.

00:01:00.231 --> 00:01:01.072
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:01.842 --> 00:01:04.412
<v><b>M:</b></v> After observing the participants for ten days,

00:01:04.578 --> 00:01:07.468
psychologists noticed several changes in their behaviour.

00:01:09.437 --> 00:01:10.138
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:10.899 --> 00:01:15.182
<v><b>F:</b></v> I couldn’t see her at first, but then I spotted her in the crowd by the fountain.